{
  "info": {
    "name": "CarCarePlus — Booking APIs",
    "description": "Complete booking API surface for CarCarePlus.\n\n**Flow**\n1. `Create → Quote` prices a submission and returns a single-use `quote_token`.\n2. `Create → Confirm` redeems it and creates the order(s); it saves the first order id into `booking_id`.\n3. `Read` and `Lifecycle` operate on `booking_id`.\n\nQuote requests auto-save `quote_token`; Confirm auto-saves `booking_id`, so you can run a Quote → Confirm → Show/Update chain without copy-pasting ids.\n\n**Endpoints**\n- POST /api/bookings/quote\n- POST /api/bookings/confirm\n- GET /api/bookings\n- GET /api/bookings/{id}\n- POST /api/bookings/{id} (update)\n- DELETE /api/bookings/{id} (cancel)\n- POST /api/bookings/{id}/assign\n- POST /api/bookings/{id}/start\n- POST /api/bookings/{id}/complete\n- GET /api/workshops/nearby (helper)\n\n**Setup** — set the collection variables: tokens (`customer1-token`, `company1-token`, `admin`) and resource ids (`car_id`, `service_id`, `branch_id`, `sub_service_id`, `material_id`, `user_package_id`, `problem_type_id`, `workshop_id`, `employee_id`, `company_car_a`, `company_car_b`).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_postman_id": "583d97ca-366e-417c-889f-4056571ae767"
  },
